# One template card check, stopping before 「Generate」 (P4 card rows, user 2026-10-20: never tap Generate).
# Starts: More (all-categories page) with the template's card fully on screen. Ends: back on More. Charges nothing.
# Detail page (preview shots 3 s apart, Mute/Unmute, tap-to-pause), Make my version, the chat opening, every format
# option (single choice per group), then Back › Stay › Back › Leave anyway › detail › Back.
# Args: $1 template slug (style_aidrama_…) · $2 screenshot prefix (e.g. tc237)
# Written 2026-10-21 (P4-a) from the TC-235 command history. The detail page is a horizontal pager over the whole
# category row and every off-screen page has its own 「Unmute」 button, so `id Mute`/`id Unmute` can hit another page and
# page over to it (first run, TC-237: landed on Merger Season) — tap the speaker by its point and `expect` the card id.
id aiMiniDramaTemplateList.AIDramaTemplateCardView.card.$1
waitfor aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.makeMyVersion --timeout 20
wait 1
expect aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.card.$1
texts $2-detail
wait 3
shot $2-preview-t2
tap 345 697
wait 1
els Unmute
shot $2-muted
tap 345 697
wait 1
els Mute
expect aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.card.$1
tap 210 430
wait 1
shot $2-paused-a
els Play
wait 2
shot $2-paused-b
tap 210 430
wait 1
expect aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.card.$1
id aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.makeMyVersion
waitfor "What format would you like for your video?" --timeout 30
wait 1
texts $2-chat-open
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.1
shot $2-fmt-l1
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.2
shot $2-fmt-l2
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.3
shot $2-fmt-l3
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.4
shot $2-fmt-l4
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.5
shot $2-fmt-l5
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.6
shot $2-fmt-l6
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.captions.1
shot $2-fmt-c1
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.0
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.captions.0
shot $2-fmt-reset
# 16.9.0 (189872, P9-i1 2026-10-23): Back at a template chat's format card leaves with no 「Leave this chat?」 dialog;
# 189729 (P4) showed it. The dialog is optional here: tapif reports whether it appeared.
id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.back
wait 2
tapif "Leave anyway"
waitfor aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.makeMyVersion --timeout 15
expect aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.card.$1
texts $2-left
id aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.back
waitfor aiMiniDramaTemplateList.UIButton.history --timeout 15
